WEBVTT

00:15:53.496 --> 00:16:00.246
And this general turned toward me and
said from the highest ranks of

00:16:00.246 --> 00:16:05.787
the Air Force, we believe you
cannot lead people that you

00:16:07.246 --> 00:16:08.246
do not feel affection toward.

00:16:10.454 --> 00:16:13.496
Which I think takes care in connection
a little another step affections,

00:16:13.496 --> 00:16:17.079
a bigger word right in my
book and I said, Huh?

00:16:17.287 --> 00:16:19.162
And he goes, Yeah, that's
that's just common.

00:16:19.454 --> 00:16:23.496
If you cannot find a way to feel
affection for people you lead,

00:16:23.787 --> 00:16:26.371
then we need to move them out
of your direct report line.

00:16:27.204 --> 00:16:31.204
You know, as you as you walk through
some of these stories and examples,